   "text": "Flink 1.20 \u2014 bars-1s job (PyFlink + SQL)\nL2 book rebuilt in keyed MapState \u00b7 OFI per event\n(Cont\u2013Kukanov\u2013Stoikov) \u00b7 1s tumbling windows\n10s exactly-once checkpoints \u2192 MinIO",
   "originalText": "Flink 1.20 \u2014 bars-1s job (PyFlink + SQL)\nL2 book rebuilt in keyed MapState \u00b7 OFI per event\n(Cont\u2013Kukanov\u2013Stoikov) \u00b7 1s tumbling windows\n10s exactly-once checkpoints \u2192 MinIO",
